  {
   "_id": "dIeQ1WdKZQb8xZ8e",
   "name": "Runa do Nada",
   "type": "equipamento",
   "img": "modules/reliquias-do-apocalipse/images/itens/runa-do-nada.webp",
   "system": {
    "description": {
     "value": "<h2 data-start=\"1222\" data-end=\"1255\"><strong data-start=\"1228\" data-end=\"1255\">AURA DO VAZIO (PASSIVA)</strong></h2><p data-start=\"1257\" data-end=\"1291\">Enquanto a arma estiver empunhada:</p><ul data-start=\"1293\" data-end=\"1397\"><li data-start=\"1293\" data-end=\"1397\"><p data-start=\"1295\" data-end=\"1332\">Inimigos a <strong data-start=\"1306\" data-end=\"1312\">3m</strong> do portador sofrem:</p><ul data-start=\"1335\" data-end=\"1397\"><li data-start=\"1335\" data-end=\"1365\"><p data-start=\"1337\" data-end=\"1365\"><strong data-start=\"1337\" data-end=\"1363\">–1 em testes de ataque</strong></p></li><li data-start=\"1368\" data-end=\"1397\"><p data-start=\"1370\" data-end=\"1397\"><strong data-start=\"1370\" data-end=\"1397\">–1 em testes de Vontade</strong></p><h2 data-start=\"1462\" data-end=\"1504\"><em data-start=\"1481\" data-end=\"1500\"><strong data-start=\"1468\" data-end=\"1502\">Pulso do Silêncio</strong></em></h2><p data-start=\"1505\" data-end=\"1569\"><strong data-start=\"1505\" data-end=\"1515\">Custo:</strong> 1 ED<br data-start=\"1520\" data-end=\"1523\" /><strong data-start=\"1523\" data-end=\"1532\">Ação:</strong> Bônus<br data-start=\"1538\" data-end=\"1541\" /><strong data-start=\"1541\" data-end=\"1549\">Uso:</strong> 1 vez por combate</p><p data-start=\"1571\" data-end=\"1639\">O portador ativa a runa e o mundo parece perder som por um instante.</p><p data-start=\"1641\" data-end=\"1652\"><strong data-start=\"1641\" data-end=\"1652\">Efeito:</strong></p><ul data-start=\"1653\" data-end=\"1815\"><li data-start=\"1653\" data-end=\"1815\"><p data-start=\"1655\" data-end=\"1680\">O próximo ataque da arma:</p><ul data-start=\"1683\" data-end=\"1815\"><li data-start=\"1683\" data-end=\"1721\"><p data-start=\"1685\" data-end=\"1721\">causa <strong data-start=\"1691\" data-end=\"1719\">+1d8 de dano de antimana</strong></p><p>Se o alvo cair a 0 PV com esse ataque:</p><ul data-start=\"1856\" data-end=\"1927\"><li data-start=\"1856\" data-end=\"1927\"><p data-start=\"1858\" data-end=\"1927\">A aura aumenta para <strong data-start=\"1878\" data-end=\"1884\">6m</strong> até o início do próximo turno do portador.</p></li></ul></li></ul></li></ul></li></ul></li></ul>",
     "unidentified": ""
    },
